<!doctype html><html lang="es"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>INTERAFAS</title><style>html,body{height:100%;margin:0;background:#050505;color:#f3f3f3;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace}main{min-height:100%;display:grid;place-items:center;padding:30px;text-align:center;background:radial-gradient(circle at 50% 40%,#361010 0,#0b0b0b 36%,#000 78%)}.box{max-width:900px}.sig{display:inline-block;border:1px solid #ff3434;color:#ff3434;padding:7px 12px;letter-spacing:.2em;font-weight:900}.glitch{font-size:clamp(46px,9vw,112px);margin:.25em 0;color:#fff;text-shadow:3px 0 #f00,-3px 0 #0ff;letter-spacing:-.06em}.claim{font-size:clamp(19px,3vw,34px);line-height:1.2}.claim strong{color:#ff3434}.note{margin:32px auto 0;max-width:650px;border-top:1px solid #333;padding-top:18px;color:#777;font-size:13px}.cursor{animation:b .8s step-end infinite}@keyframes b{50%{opacity:0}}</style></head><body><main><div class="box"><div class="sig">SYSTEM OVERRIDDEN</div><h1 class="glitch">INTERAFAS</h1><p class="claim">“El gobierno no sirve si ni siquiera puede proteger aquello de lo que depende la ciudad.”</p><p>— <strong>COLECTIVO UMBRAL</strong> <span class="cursor">█</span></p><div class="note">Contenido mostrado dentro del escenario del incidente. El portal institucional se encuentra temporalmente indisponible.</div></div></main></body></html>